e months of fiscal year 2026, compared to $345,081 for the first nine months of fiscal year 2025.</span></p><p style="text-indent:3.333%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The increases in Aerospace segment earnings were due to the following:</span></p>
